# Published results keep the numbers (metrics, bootstrap, ratings, figures).
# The raw per-run tensors and weights stay local: they are ~820 MB of LFS and
# every number in the paper is recomputable from what is kept.
# Whitelist: only the numbers travel. Weights, tensors and per-epoch logs are
# ~2.5 GB of LFS and every published figure is recomputable from what is kept.
results/predictions/**
!results/predictions/**/
!results/predictions/**/metrics.json
!results/predictions/**/hparams.json
results/evaluation_statistics/
results/*_audit_report.json
pytest-of-chemist/
.claude
